{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take care of a small egg that lives on your desktop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A relaxing idle game where your egg grows even while you\u2019re away!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is very simple.<br>Give your egg a name, and then just wait and watch.<br>But an egg won't hatch on its own.<br>Take care of it by managing its temperature and stress levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As time passes, cracks will start to appear, and eventually, a SlimeMonster called &quot;Slimeon&quot; will be born.<br>There are <strong>50 different Slimeon</strong> to discover!<br>Raise them all and complete your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/gif_2.gif?t=1742705506\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595790?t=1742705506","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/8c2369dbc50add3cc01876a92e3fab2842c84c47/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742705506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/8a88aae0759b463d9ea98657847b6b2f98b6f5b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742705506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/8a88aae0759b463d9ea98657847b6b2f98b6f5b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742705506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take care of a small egg that lives on your desktop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A relaxing idle game where your egg grows even while you\u2019re away!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is very simple.